WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Akuma starts with a corner forward throw.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:02.700
Akuma rushes toward the downed opponent.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.350
Standing jab misses while Ryu is down.

4
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.300
Akuma throws Ryu again after the timing jab.

5
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.250
Ryu lands beside the corner after the second throw.
